[Graphics:Player Legs]
The area around the player is coloured by the player's health (see #R$C065): bright white at full health, then bright yellow, and bright green when the player is nearly dead. The sprites are shown here in white, as they are at full health.
#UDGTABLE(default,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre,centre)
  { #N$10 | #SPRITE$10,attr=$47(player-legs-a-frame-1-colour*) | #N$11, #N$15 | #SPRITE$11,attr=$47(player-legs-a-frame-2-colour*) | #N$12, #N$14 | #SPRITE$12,attr=$47(player-legs-a-frame-3-colour*) | #N$13 | #SPRITE$13,attr=$47(player-legs-a-frame-4-colour*) }
  { #N$16 | #SPRITE$16,attr=$47(player-bumping-body-a-colour*) | #N$18 | #SPRITE$18,attr=$47(player-legs-b-frame-1-colour*) | #N$19, #N$1D | #SPRITE$19,attr=$47(player-legs-b-frame-2-colour*) | #N$1A, #N$1C | #SPRITE$1A,attr=$47(player-legs-b-frame-3-colour*) }
  { #N$1B | #SPRITE$1B,attr=$47(player-legs-b-frame-4-colour*) | #N$1E | #SPRITE$1E,attr=$47(player-bumping-body-b-colour*) }
UDGTABLE#

[Graphics:Player Body]
The area around the player is coloured by the player's health (see #R$C065): bright white at full health, then bright yellow, and bright green when the player is nearly dead. The sprites are shown here in white, as they are at full health.
